{"id":"wb-6-873","name":"吐峪沟石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"吐峪沟石窟","text":"吐峪沟石窟（英语：The Tuyoq Buddhist Grottoes）始凿于公元5世纪前后，沿用至公元14世纪，现存洞窟157座、地面寺院3座、佛塔9座，是古代高昌地区开凿时代最早、年代跨度涵盖整个高昌佛教史、营建规模最大且洞窟类型最为齐全的佛教石窟寺院遗址群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%90%E5%B3%AA%E6%B2%9F%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":94931267,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94931267","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fe434f39e1c06b093b49b6b8.jpg","title":"Kneussel_Tuyuk_caves.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kneussel_Tuyuk_caves.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/Kneussel_Tuyuk_caves.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gregor Kneussel","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区吐鲁番市鄯善县吐峪沟石窟悬崖","width":320,"height":427}}